      </div>
      <div class="sp2-foundation">
        <span class="sp2-foundation-num">09</span>
        <h3 class="sp2-foundation-title">Psychometric-grade rigor</h3>
        <p class="sp2-foundation-body">Every design decision reviewed against the methodology. No pattern that compromised statistical validity survived review. The firm's credibility was the constraint, not an afterthought.</p>
      </div>
